OL,3,GNEWSAMore teens with chronic pain think
OL,4,Aof self-harm
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department of Health and Social
OL,7,FCare they were working to ensure young
OL,8,Fpeople who need mental health support,
OL,9,Fincluding those suffering from chronic
OL,10,Fpain, were able to access it "at the
OL,11,Fearliest opportunity".
